  "cellSizeM": 2.0,
  "notes": [
    "Tier 3 with long outer bends: A and B take their detours early, C dips low and returns.",
    "Route A: conveyor on the stepped section (A2), a gate with a paired hazard (A3), final hazard (A4), then the final code note.",
    "Route B: a patrolled loop on the first run, cart ride (B2), gate (B3), another gate/hazard slot (B4), then the final token.",
    "Route C: a loop, a conveyor on the lowest run (C2), gate (C3) and the final service cart (C4).",
    "A3, B3 and C3 accept the carried T2_OPS and T1_MAINT permissions as optional shortcuts."
  ],
